究極の牛丼を作るという夢
The dream of making the ultimate gyudon!

105
00:10:54,016 --> 00:10:56,516
牛丼において大事なのは...
What's important in gyudon is...

106
00:10:57,016 --> 00:10:58,516
肉、玉ねぎ。
Meat and onions.

107
00:10:59,016 --> 00:11:03,016
