These two ingredients are especially important, right?

108
00:11:04,016 --> 00:11:07,516
いや～これは行くしかない、やるしかない！
Man... we have to go, we have to do this!

109
00:11:08,016 --> 00:11:12,516
白銀ノエル、究極牛丼を作る旅に出やす！
Shirogane Noel, setting out on a journey to make the ultimate gyudon!

