ノエ旅あびゃや！全国おいしい発見！～高級食材で牛丼づくりに挑む～
Noe-tabi Abyaya! Delicious Discoveries Across Japan! ～Challenging Gyudon Making with Luxury Ingredients～

113
00:11:42,516 --> 00:11:45,016
みなさん、こんまっする！
Everyone, kon-muscle!

114
00:11:46,016 --> 00:11:49,816
牛丼ハンター白銀ノエルこと団長白銀ノエルです！
Gyudon Hunter Shirogane Noel, Captain Shirogane Noel!

