This is the Kobe Ohashi Bridge!

117
00:11:57,016 --> 00:11:59,516
でけ～！風つえ～！
Huge~! So windy~!

118
00:12:00,516 --> 00:12:03,016
団長のお目当てはここ神戸にあります。
The Captain's target is right here in Kobe.

119
